#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: ship-today-delivery-dates.php
msgid "Ship Today & Delivery Dates for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Ship Today & Delivery Dates for WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: ship-today-delivery-dates.php
msgid ""
"Countdown to the order cutoff time with the next ship and delivery dates "
"(shortcode [stdd_notice]), plus an optional ship date choice at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Odliczanie do godziny granicznej z najbliższą datą wysyłki i dostawy "
"(shortcode [stdd_notice]) oraz opcjonalny wybór terminu wysyłki w checkoucie."

#. Author of the plugin
#: ship-today-delivery-dates.php
msgid "MS-M.pl"
msgstr "MS-M.pl"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: ship-today-delivery-dates.php
msgid "https://ms-m.pl"
msgstr "https://ms-m.pl"

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:156
#: includes/class-stdd-checkout.php:191
msgid "required"
msgstr "wymagane"

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:158
#: includes/class-stdd-checkout.php:162 includes/class-stdd-checkout.php:197
#: includes/class-stdd-checkout.php:225
msgid "No delivery dates available. Please contact us."
msgstr "Brak dostępnych terminów dostawy. Skontaktuj się z nami."

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:192
msgid ""
"Ship date tiles. The dates are calculated at checkout. Without this block "
"the checkout has no ship date choice."
msgstr ""
"Kafelki z terminem wysyłki. Terminy są liczone w checkoucie. Bez tego bloku "
"w checkoucie nie ma wyboru terminu."

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:195
msgid "Shows the ship date selected in the \"Ship date\" block."
msgstr "Pokazuje termin wybrany w bloku „Termin wysyłki”."

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:196
msgid ""
"Hidden: the order summary row is turned off in WooCommerce → Settings → "
"Delivery dates → Checkout."
msgstr ""
"Ukryty: wiersz w podsumowaniu zamówienia jest wyłączony w WooCommerce → "
"Ustawienia → Terminy dostawy → Checkout."

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:409
msgid "Ship Today & Delivery Dates:"
msgstr "Ship Today & Delivery Dates:"

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:410
msgid ""
"the block checkout has no \"Ship date\" block, so customers cannot choose a "
"ship date (orders are placed without it). Add the block inside the checkout "
"form in the checkout page editor."
msgstr ""
"checkout blokowy nie ma bloku „Termin wysyłki”, więc klienci nie wybierają "
"terminu (zamówienia przechodzą bez niego). Dodaj blok wewnątrz formularza "
"checkoutu w edytorze strony zamówienia."

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:412
msgid "Edit the checkout page"
msgstr "Edytuj stronę zamówienia"

#: includes/class-stdd-checkout-blocks.php:414
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Nie pokazuj więcej"

